    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/harness-tiles.md#provenance-9",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "\"Harness\" carries TWO senses, and only one of them is this rule",
      "prov:value": "The first draft of this section said \"5 of 19\" and was stale within the hour: the DAK layer was instantiated by #1129 while this page sat in review, making it 6.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/harness-tiles.md#provenance-10",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "\"Harness\" carries TWO senses, and only one of them is this rule",
      "prov:value": "The FHIR IG layer's own description says *\"what a non-WHO implementation guide instantiates\"*, and the WHO layer describes its own base harness the same way; the owner's bean titles use it — `2yyh` **SMART-BASE HARNESS**, `wm63` **FHIR-HARNESS**.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`2yyh`",
        "`wm63`",
        "owner's"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/harness-tiles.md#provenance-11",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Do not write a checker for this",
      "prov:value": "Ten came from one generator template, four from the retired declaration filename that `check:declaration-filename` already counts (not written out here — that gate flagged this very paragraph for naming it, which is the gate working), the rest from directory listings, hyphenated ids, and the check flagging its own docstring."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/harness-tiles.md#provenance-12",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "A tile opens the INSTANCE, not a kind handler's view of it",
      "prov:value": "`scripts/mount-instance-docs.ts` carries the owner's own rule for the two routes:",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner's"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/harness-tiles.md#provenance-13",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "An inert row SAYS why, and \"no viewer\" is four answers",
      "prov:value": "Until 2026-09-23 the two navbar surfaces disagreed about whether it was said at all: the Jekyll sidebar carried `title=\"declared, with no published viewer\"` on a `<span>`, and the mounted rail carried `opacity:.55` and no words.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-23"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/harness-tiles.md#provenance-14",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "An inert row SAYS why, and \"no viewer\" is four answers",
      "prov:value": "Both are `gjli`, for different reasons, and both are worth recognising elsewhere:",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`gjli`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/harness-tiles.md#provenance-15",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "An inert row SAYS why, and \"no viewer\" is four answers",
      "prov:value": "The dim was not even a contrast failure here — measured, `opacity:.55` over `#1f2328` composites to 5.03:1 — which is the point: it passed the ratio and still said nothing."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/harness-tiles.md#provenance-16",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "An inert row SAYS why, and \"no viewer\" is four answers",
      "prov:value": "| |---|---|---| | declared `publish: \"staging-only\"` | staging only | **no** — withheld on purpose | | instance declares `renderExemption.of: [\"visualiser\"]` | no viewer by design | **no** — the owner's 2026-09-20 ruling | | a viewer exists off the conventional path | viewer not published | yes, and a different one | | nothing declares a viewer | no viewer yet | yes |",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner's",
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/harness-tiles.md#provenance-17",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "A tile, or an avatar? WHO DECLARED IT (settled 2026-09-21)",
      "prov:value": "The question this skill left open, in the owner's words: *\"use same SQUARE TILES that are in the expanding menu of LHS navbar **OR use theme/avatars as appropriate**\"*.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner's"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/harness-tiles.md#provenance-18",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
