      "cat-harness:section": "Where a tile lives, and what it must not eat",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-10-02 (issue #1905, bean `t6ht`): *\"stickies panel shouldnt have all those icons\"*. That reverses the 2026-09-21 ruling (bean `v0jv`) which put a \"Visualisations\" strip of square tiles along the top of every sticky board — on every board, not only the landing one, because the ruling names the panel rather than a page.",
