      "cat-harness:section": "On a folio's own site, a tile describes the FOLIO (issue #2263)",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-10-06, on a content instance's published site, paraphrased: the beans and todos badges showed counts from folio-assistant rather than from the instance whose site it was, and the links to beans and todos did not work — fix the process and the skills.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
